al steps rely on these false statements, rendering the final conclusion unsupported.\n\nAdditionally, the lemma about the orthocenter is used without proof (a **Justification Gap**).  \n\nBecause the core geometric relationships are incorrectly established, the solution does **not** constitute a valid proof of the problem statement. \u220e"
