\), or by analysing the spiral similarity that sends segment \\(CD\\) to \\(EF\\) and that fixes \\(A\\). Such an analysis would eventually lead to the desired angle equality (R2) and hence to the tangency statement.\n\n---\n\n**Conclusion**  \n\nThe three lemmas above are proved rigorously and constitute solid intermediate results. The final step\u2014showing that the line through the orthocenter \\(H\\) parallel to \\(AP\\) is tangent to the circum\u2011circle of \\(\\triangle BEF\\)\u2014remains open. Further investigation, building on the established lemmas, is required to complete the proof."
