\nThe precise angle\u2011chasing steps have not been fully worked out here; they constitute the missing bridge between the established lemmas and the final tangency statement.\n\n--------------------------------------------------------------------\n**Conclusion**\n\nThe three lemmas proved above are rigorous and constitute the essential geometric backbone of the problem. The final deduction that the line through the orthocentre \\(H\\) of \\(\\triangle PMN\\) parallel to \\(AP\\) is tangent to the circumcircle of \\(\\triangle BEF\\) remains unproved in this write\u2011up. Further work is required to complete the angle\u2011chasing argument that links the established configuration to the desired tangency. \u220e"
